{"h":"<h2><strong>Flux2_klein-SDXL_Upscale_workflow</strong></h2><p><strong>（文字转图像高档）</strong></p><p>此工作流程的目的是混合<strong>Flux2_克莱因</strong>卓越的即时跟踪和高图像质量，具有杰出的 SDXL 的巨大<strong>自动增益控制</strong>人物资源。</p><p>换句话说，这些字符<strong>Flux2_克莱因</strong>尚未学习的内容可以使用 illustrious-SDXL 的学习资源来表达，而无需使用 Lora。</p><p>它结合了<strong>Flux2_克莱因</strong>SDXL 可实现极快的生成速度。</p><p>这就是我的使用方式，但您可以按照自己的方式使用它。</p><p><strong>*注意*</strong></p><p><strong>关闭 Upscale-Switch，仅渲染 Flux2_klein。</strong></p><p>可用作常规 Flux2_klein 工作流程</p><p>不会提升任何东西</p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/295a833241fd8566.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><strong>高档比例1.5至2.0（推荐1.5）</strong></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/b0a567b6620d1cf5.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><h3><strong>要求</strong></h3><p>ComfyUI版本。 0.9.1 或更高</p><h2><strong>Flux2_克莱因</strong></h2><p><strong>型号</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4b-fp8/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors?download=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors</a></p><p>或</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors?download=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Flux-2-klein-4b.safetensors</a></p><p><strong>文本编码器</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_4b.safetensors</a></p><p><strong>VAE</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors</a></p><p><strong>杰出模特</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/search/models?baseModel=Illustrious&amp;modelType=Checkpoint&amp;sortBy=models_v9&amp;query=Illustrious\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>奇维泰 |分享您的模型 杰出的检查站</u></a></p><p>还推荐<a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/ukr8b3g201/models?baseModels=Illustrious\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"> <u>我的合并模型</u></a></p><p><strong>DMD2 速度 LoRA</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/api/download/models/1820705?type=Model&amp;format=SafeTensor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>dmd2_sdxl_4step_lora_fp16</u></a>或<a href=\"https://civitai.com/api/download/models/1820946?type=Model&amp;format=SafeTensor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"><u>dmd2_sdxl_4step_lora_fp32</u></a></p><p><strong>推荐升级版</strong>棒棒糖</p><p><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/uwg/upscaler/blob/main/ESRGAN/lollypop.pth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://huggingface.co/uwg/upscaler/blob/main/ESRGAN/lollypop.pth</a></p><p><strong>使用自定义节点</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/yolain/ComfyUI-Easy-Use</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/LEv145/images-grid-comfy-plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/LEv145/images-grid-comfy-plugin</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pixelpainter/comfyui-mute-bypass-by-ID\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pixelpainter/comfyui-mute-bypass-by-ID</a></p><p><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/8af115989b9c5252.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"assets/files/civitai/img/dff00cca6c6ca80c.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":"[object Object]"}